  "description": "One materialized conversation block — **the mirror of\n`agents logs list`'s `ResponseItem`**, variant-for-variant and\nfield-for-field, with parts carrying opened content instead of\n`read id` addresses; plus the additional `Error` block (a logged\nfailure — the list gains the same variant). Produced by the\nlistener's incremental coalescer; blocks appear in conversation\norder with `read_all`'s exact boundary rule.",
  "anyOf": [
    {
      "title": "RequestMessageUser",
      "description": "A `user`-role message from the request/task input.",
      "type": "object",
